// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1637922811" "Thank goodness you're here, {HeroName}! I really need your help. One of the heroes I work with, the Justifier, hasn't come back from his last mission. I asked him to investigate some caves inhabited by the Devouring Earth, but that was two days ago. I haven't seen him since! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Please find the Justifier for me.</A> You only have 1 hour to find him!"
// AcceptString :
"P643252029" "Find the Justifier"
// SendOffString :
"P757908552" "Thanks, {HeroName}. I won't forget this. If anything's happened to Justifier, this city has suffered a great loss. Finding him is important, but be careful. I don't want you to succumb to whatever happened to him."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3668293732" "No, I still haven't heard from the Justifier. Please keep looking!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P528285844" "There's a strong smell of mold and pollen in the air. You hope the Justifier doesn't have too many allergies."

