// Dialog :
"P2824677469" "My God. I can hardly believe that creature was once my old friend, the Justifier. Thank you, {HeroName}, for bringing him in. I don't know if he can ever be helped, but at least he won't be a danger to the people he once protected."
// RandomFameString :
"P3613086685" "Did you hear that the Justifier went bad? Well, luckily {HeroName} was there to bring him in."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2830984499" "Thank you for trying, {HeroName}, but I'm afraid we'll never get the old Justifier back. Apparently, the Devouring Earth have mutated him into some strange creature like themselves. It's a sad, sad fate for a hero. I'm sure the Justifier would rather have died than become a monster."
// RandomFameString :
"P558126768" "Do you remember that hero, the Justifier? I wonder what happened to him."

