// IntroString :
"P3112626943" "Did you read in the paper that Yellow Rose Cosmetics has been accused of cruelty to animals? Well, apparently the Devouring Earth are up on current events. They've staged a raid against the Yellow Rose offices. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to stop that raid, {HeroName}, and prevent the Devouring Earth from killing any of the office workers.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2124218756" "Stop the raid and prevent the Devouring Earth from killing innocent office workers"
// SendOffString :
"P3102563440" "The Devouring Earth sure have some strange ideas about justice. We can't have them exacting vengeance on innocent citizens."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2940257685" "Defeat all creatures in office"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P316027056" "The Devouring Earth are still rampaging in those offices. Get over there, quick!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3556605747" "The heady scent of a dozen perfumes almost masks the tell-tale whiff of humus that tells you the Devouring Earth is here."

