"P242484314" "Enzyme pills"
// DetailString :
"P3330208318" "Thousands of these small clear capsules are held together in a gooey gel. The word 'Enzyme' has been scrawled on the outside of the barrel."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2233401341" "I've got a report that a mob of Freaks is mounting a raid on a cave known to be inhabited by the Devouring Earth. I don't know what their beef is with these creatures, but it's the innocent bystanders who will suffer if the fight escalates out of control. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to stop the Freakshow attack on the Devouring Earth.</A> Lives depend upon it. I'd say that you'll have maybe 2 hours before this gets out of hand."
// AcceptString :
"P193098466" "Stop the Freakshow attack on the Devouring Earth"
// SendOffString :
"P3024492638" "Be careful, {HeroName}. The Freakshow  may be gunning for the Devouring Earth, but they won't hesitate to switch their attentions to you. In order to put a stop to this, you'll need to take out the raid's leader, a Tank Freak called 'Lawless'. You also need to find out what the Freakshow were after and secure it before they can."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2645894781" "End Freakshow/Devouring Earth war"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2101464550" "You haven't stopped that Freakshow raid. Hurry, there may still be time!"

