// Dialog :
"P407685112" "Wow, {HeroName}, these pills you found are remarkable. Each pill contains a potent package of enzymes that accelerate the rate at which the body metabolizes new material. When combined with a Devouring Earth mutagen, these pills would make a person mutate at an alarming rate. You say this is what the Freakshow was after? My guess is they wanted to increase the rate at which they metabolize Excelsior. It's a good thing you got to them first; the Freaks are bad enough as they are!"
// RandomFameString :
"P1082805152" "I heard {HeroName} sure taught the Freakshow and the Devouring Earth a lesson."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P35768673" "Tough luck, {HeroName}, I know you tried. At least the police were able to keep the battle from ranging too far out of control, and we learned what the Freakshow were after. The Devouring Earth have developed a new enzyme that can increase the rate at which the body metabolizes new material. When combined with a Devouring Earth mutagen, these pills would make a person mutate at an alarming rate. My guess is the Freakshow wanted to increase the rate at which they metabolize Excelsior. I only hope they didn't get away with much!"
// RandomFameString :
"P2449955041" "With these constant gang wars, I guess no place in this city is safe."

