// Clue - DevouringMutant 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P653410675" "Devouring Earth mutant"
// DetailString :
"P2790003627" "One of the Devouring Earth creatures you defeated had strange mutations, the likes of which you have never seen before. A pair of gill-like slits runs up each side of the creature's neck, and a grossly swollen throat indicates the likely presence of new glandular material."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - MutagenicSporeInfo 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2351990379" "Mutagenic spore analysis"
// DetailString :
"P3996670749" "According to Wilma Peterson's findings, these Devouring Earth creatures are able to release mutagenic spores from the gill-like slits in their throats. Borne on the air, these spores would be impossible to contain, and would likely transform hundreds of Paragon City citizens into minions of the Devouring Earth."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3010528811" "A horde of Devouring Earth creatures was just spotted swarming the offices of Wolffe, Wolffe, & Wolffe, the law firm. It seems the Wolffes are arguing a big case on behalf of the logging industry, and the Devouring Earth wants them dead before they can make their closing remarks. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Someone has to save those lawyers from the Devouring Earth.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1281655833" "Save the lawyers from the Devouring Earth"
// SendOffString :
"P1151108696" "The Wolffe firm has a long history of fighting environmental regulation. To be honest, I'm surprised something like this hasn't happened before."

