"P2605969610" "You're right. In all my efforts cleaning up after the Devoured, I've never come across a mutation like this. Just give me a second to write up my findings. In fact, let's get {ContactName} on the phone right now and discuss the situation.<br><br>{HeroName}, {ContactName} says you've got to get over to the Pinckney & Sons Law Firm right away! I guess the Devouring Earth isn't through taking the law into its own hands."

