// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2355487806" "{HeroName} not stop dimension crossing!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P18434142" "The scientists at Portal Corporation are among the most brilliant minds of Paragon City. To lose one would be a tragedy."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3207072007" "We shall sink roots deep in new soil."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3147511738" "{HeroName} shall not stop spread of Devouring Earth!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - HostageScientists 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P613835953" "Scientist"
// Description :
"P4245099803" "scientists to save"
// SingularDescription :
"P159809516" "Save the last scientist!"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P3232715632" "I can't thank you enough, {Rescuer}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1952220194" "You defeated the Devouring Earth and saved Zyla's home dimension."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3511608652" "Good work, {HeroName}. Apparently trying to assimilate the rest of this world isn't enough for the Devouring Earth. Zyla's home dimension is far less advanced than ours. If the creatures had entered that portal, they probably would have succeeded in transforming the entire planet into their hideous concept of Eden."
// RandomFameString :
"P2560194750" "{HeroName}'s a hero to two dimensions!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6_DevouringEarth_Errand1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P519681416" "The Devouring Earth are a terrible threat to the future and safety of Paragon City, {HeroName}, and their numbers keep on growing. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Heroes need to fight the Devouring Earth's monsters wherever they appear.</A> Can you do your part against them?"
// AcceptString :
"P1097632220" "Fight the Devouring Earth wherever they appear"
// SendOffString :
"P4049007938" "Devouring Earth's creatures have been seen in Crey's Folly, and of course they're all over in Eden. Anywhere you can stop them will help, though."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1806311919" "Combat Devouring Earth menace"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1859674447" "I need you to defeat some more Devouring Earth creatures."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2808769858" "You have defeated enough Devouring Earth."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2551402992" "The Devouring Earth are a constant threat to every person in this city, {HeroName}. It's only thanks to heroes like you that people can be safe from them."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6_DevouringEarth_Errand2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3801066354" "Crey's Folly is an environmental wasteland, heavily polluted after the Rikti blew up a secret Crey Facility in the early days of the war. The Devouring Earth have been making inroads into the area, accosting any one else they find there and making it impossible to even properly assess the damage. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need a hero who can get to Crey's Folly and help clear the Devouring Earth out of there.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P408039174" "Go to Crey's Folly and defeat Devouring Earth"
// SendOffString :
"P3006242782" "Good luck, {HeroName}. There are reports of Devouring Earth creatures around the old Crey Factories and the Paragon Water Works, but I'm sure any part of the zone would welcome your help."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2142704585" "Defeat Devouring Earth in Crey's Folly"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2596858366" "You need to defeat Devouring Earth in Crey's Folly."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3113117345" "You have cleared enough Devouring Earth out of Crey's Folly."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P929576984" "Pushing the Devouring Earth out of Crey's Folly is going to be a long battle, {HeroName}. Steps like this are part of the long road to that goal."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL6_DevouringEarth_Errand3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2573823448" "If you've been in Founders' Falls lately, you know that the Devouring Earth are making a lot of headway in their efforts to control the zone. If we're not careful, they may manage to turn it into another Eden. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I would like to ask you to take the battle to the Devouring Earth in Founders' Falls.</A> It's a dangerous place, though, so I would recommend you go there in force."
// AcceptString :
"P3615844579" "Take the fight to the Devouring Earth in Founders' Falls"
// SendOffString :
"P354209247" "Go in force, {HeroName}; the Devouring Earth aren't playing around in there. There has been a lot of activity in Louis Forest and Hutchinson Park. You should be able to find them there, but don't worry about limiting yourself to those areas."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4168412434" "Stop monsters in Founders' Falls"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2236532804" "Founders' Falls's a dangerous place, {HeroName}; it will take constant action by brave heroes like you to keep it intact."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3530319074" "You have defeated enough Devouring Earth in Founders' Falls."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3362230720" "It will be a long time before Founders' Falls is safe, {HeroName}, but with heroes like you out there fighting, that day doesn't seem so far off at all."

