// IntroString :
"P729874908" "I've got a report that a mob of Freaks is mounting a raid on an area known to be inhabited by the Devouring Earth. I don't know what their beef is with these creatures, but it's the innocent bystanders who will suffer if the fight escalates out of control. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to stop the Freakshow attack on the Devouring Earth.</A> Lives depend upon it. You only have 90 minutes to stop the battle."
// SendOffString :
"P3550402496" "The area's been contained by an emergency force field for now. In order to put a stop to this, you'll need to take out the raid's leader, a Tank Freak called Lawless. You also need to find out what the Freakshow were after and secure it before they can."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4054983878" "Defeat Lawless & his crew"

